# INT-SOURCE: ../functional/59_float_abi_calls.my
# INT-ENGINES: tw default nj noopt
#
# INT unit (#107) over tests/functional/59_float_abi_calls.my:
# Float ops that CALL C++ or libm with a float argument, in runs that pin
# float locals: fmod (`%`), pow/sqrt/exp, a compound element `%=` (the store
# helper takes its value in xmm0) and `/=`.
#
# It runs as a coverage unit under the engines above, with no second
# copy (INT-SOURCE): code no other unit reaches. It asserts its own
# results, and every engine must print the same.
